    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the house and try to escape from this nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not miss anything unusual. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find something unusual, use the tools on the table in the living room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do not find anything strange, sleep in your bed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't find anything unusual, go to bed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To go out of the house through the front door on the &quot;6th&quot; when there is no anomaly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you make a wrong choice, you will be returned to &quot;day 1&quot;. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30~60 minutes </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About video distribution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may distribute your video without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is possible only when you use the functions provided by the video distribution site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title of the video and distribution, and a link to the Steam page in the summary section.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the house and try to escape from this nightmare. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not miss anything unusual. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find something unusual, use the tools on the table in the living room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do not find anything strange, sleep in your bed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't find anything unusual, go to bed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To go out of the house through the front door on the &quot;6th&quot; when there is no anomaly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you make a wrong choice, you will be returned to &quot;day 1&quot;. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30~60 minutes </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About video distribution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may distribute your video without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is possible only when you use the functions provided by the video distribution site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title of the video and distribution, and a link to the Steam page in the summary section.</p>",
